# Battery charge thresholds for the HONOR MagicBook Pro 14 (FMB-P).
#
# The embedded controller only enforces the three OEM preset ranges — arbitrary
# pairs are silently ignored:
#
#   40 70    maximise battery lifespan
#   70 90    balanced (default)
#   95 100   maximise capacity
#
# Format is "START END". Requires BIOS >= 1.16 (earlier firmware exposes the sysfs
# node but does not enforce it).
#
# Apply a change:   sudo systemctl restart honor-battery-thresholds.service
# Check the result: cat /sys/devices/platform/huawei-wmi/charge_control_thresholds
#
# If you use the GNOME "Battery Health Charging" extension, its Quick Settings panel
# is pre-configured (by honor-fmbp-config) with these same three presets.
BATTERY_THRESHOLD="70 90"
